# checkouts are not source (the chorus affected-test scan excludes these too)
_site_check/
.claude/worktrees/

# eval/mobile-shots/*.png (2026-09-28): screenshots overwritten by every run
# of mobile-e2e.mjs / eval/mobile-e2e.mjs ("so a person can SEE what a phone
# shows" — ARCHITECTURE.md documents them only as driver scripts, never as
# producing committed evidence). Not referenced by deploy-pages.yml (the
# repo's only workflow) or any test — every pass/fail in eval/mobile-e2e.mjs
# is against live page state via Playwright/CDP, never the screenshot bytes.
# Three of the eight (03-tabs.png, 04-turn-start.png, 05-turn-done.png) were
# byte-identical duplicates, itself evidence nobody reviews them as-tracked.
# Same shape of file goldens/conduct/.gitignore already excludes for that
# golden's own raw output — extended here.
eval/mobile-shots/
